Subject: [PATCH 3/7] rust_bingen support for 15.5 macosx sdk

Summary:
```
/Applications/Xcode_16.4.0_16F6_fb.app/Contents/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX15.5.sdk/usr/include/_string.h:176:73: error: unknown type name 'rsize_t'
```

Test Plan:
```
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz -k &> ~/build.logs.txt
```
---
 crates/grpcio-sys/Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/crates/grpcio-sys/Android.bp b/crates/grpcio-sys/Android.bp
index 0c57ac9b..b9b4663c 100644
--- a/crates/grpcio-sys/Android.bp
+++ b/crates/grpcio-sys/Android.bp
@@ -100,6 +100,7 @@ rust_bindgen {
         "--blocklist-type=gpr_once",
     ],
     min_sdk_version: "29",
+    cpp_std: "gnu++17",
 }
 
 rust_test {
